            "review_text": "Handoko T\nTangerang, Indonesia431 contributions\n0\nWorth Trying\nJan 2017 • Couples\nWe were here as the shuttlebus from the port terminated at this place, so why not had something light. My wife was tempted by the Pho with kobe beef banner at the entrance of the restaurant and I selected the fried rice as that was the only one for pescetarian. Mine was good and according to my wife the Pho was good either. Nice atmosphere and good service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 30, 2017",
