            "review_text": "Robyn-Wendy\nHorsham, Australia692 contributions\n0\nGood food, service and atmosphere\nApr 2013\nDiners can choose a more formal seat indoors but we sat on the terrace adjacent to a water wall in the beautiful pool area where cool film clips were playing on a big screen. Staff are very attentive. We had chicken in a pot and beef lulac and both were delicious. Kids had pizzas and spag bolognaise and were happy with their choices. The ice creams are yummy. We didn't realise it was happy hour so got two cocktails each for price of one. Good value and enjoyable evening.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 9, 2013",
